---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Coaching Programs"
  description="Christine Kahane offers Executive, Entrepreneur, Breakthrough, Transformational, Divorce, and Artist Activation coaching programs. Find the one that fits your needs."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Coaching Practice</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Find the Program<br><em>That Fits.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-subhead">My coaching programs are designed so we can find the one that fits your needs. All sessions are virtual.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       PROGRAMS
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-programs">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Executive Coaching -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up" id="executive">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">01</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Executive Coaching</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Agile Leadership</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">24 sessions · 6 months</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">$10,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Pay in Full</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Save $300</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>Together we build your capacity to create and develop your leadership style. You learn and assemble a toolkit to release and transform career stressors so you gain agility in your leadership. We develop your career purpose, and design your legacy for meaningful, purpose-driven contributions.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">What's included</span>
            <div class="include-item">Action plans to build healthy habits</div>
            <div class="include-item">Communication Sciences Assessment tools</div>
            <div class="include-item">TriMetrix assessment — a predictive measurement report to forecast directions for your development</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Entrepreneur Coaching -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up" id="entrepreneur">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">02</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Entrepreneur Coaching</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Building Your Foundation</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">16 sessions · 4 months</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">$7,500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Pay in Full</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Save $200</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>Developed to help you build your business pillars. We create your Core Values, Purpose, Mission, and Business Structure based on your competencies and acumen. We focus on life/work integration, how to tell your story, and how to initiate healthy habits.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">What's included</span>
            <div class="include-item">Action plans for financial plans, marketing templates, and leadership guidance</div>
            <div class="include-item">Foundational skills building tools using Communications Sciences Assessments</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Your Breakthrough Life -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up" id="breakthrough">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">03</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Your Breakthrough Life</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Toward Healthiest Habits</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">12 sessions · 3 months</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">$3,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Pay in Full</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Save $100</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This program is designed to surface specific dynamics in your relationship with self and guide your belief systems toward healthiest habits and wellbeing.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">What's included</span>
            <div class="include-item">Action plans to build healthy habits</div>
            <div class="include-item">All assessments included</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Transformational Masterwork -->
      <div class="program-row program-row--featured fade-up" id="masterwork">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">04</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Transformational Masterwork</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Full Integration</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">40 sessions · 12 months</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">$30,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Pay in Full</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Save $1,000</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>We work together to surface, then integrate your innate genius into all aspects of your life and work. Through our sessions you will be harnessing the power of your acumen, competencies, and potential to fuel your unique contributions for your life, career, and the world around you.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">What's included</span>
            <div class="include-item">Action plans to build healthy habits</div>
            <div class="include-item">All assessments included</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Divorce Coaching -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up" id="divorce">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">05</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Divorce Coaching</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Life After Marriage</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Single Client</span>
              <span class="meta-value">4 sessions · $800</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Couples</span>
              <span class="meta-value">4 sessions · $1,400</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This program is designed specifically to reach agreements prior to litigation. We work on your emotional well-being in the shifting landscape divorce presents. I work with your attorney and other experts on your team to help you navigate decisions for you and your family.</p>
          <p>Our goals together include your ability to co-create outcomes that work for the greatest good, gaining self-trust, and releasing what doesn't serve your successful future.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">Credentials</span>
            <div class="include-item">Member: Colorado Collaborative Divorce Professionals</div>
            <div class="include-item">Certified Conflict Resolution Mediator: Colorado Bar Association</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Artist Activation -->
      <div class="program-row fade-up" id="artist">
        <div class="program-left">
          <span class="program-num">06</span>
          <h2 class="program-title">Artist Activation</h2>
          <p class="program-tagline">Your Creative Genius</p>
          <div class="program-meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="meta-value">12 sessions · 3 months</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Investment</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Sliding scale</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <span class="meta-label">Format</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Individual + Group</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="program-right">
          <p>This program is created to transform you into a risk-taker — to help you integrate your vulnerability, release the masks that keep you stuck. We will use dream-work, expressive arts, and journaling to surface your new story.</p>
          <p>The results harness your strengths so you are creating brilliance through your craft.</p>
          <div class="program-includes">
            <span class="includes-label">What's included</span>
            <div class="include-item">Action plans to build healthy habits and expand your ability to take creative risks</div>
            <div class="include-item">Individual and group coaching options available</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       CTA
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h2 class="cta-title">Not sure which program is right for you?</h2>
        <p class="cta-body">Book a complimentary consultation. Christine will help you identify the program that best fits your needs, goals, and life circumstances.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary-light">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --gold:       #C4922A;
    --silver:     #8C9490;
    --limestone:  #EEF2F1;
    --warm-white: #F4F7F6;
    --warm-white-2: #EFF3F2;
    --green:      #18332F;
    --green-mid:  #1f4038;
    --body-color: #2C3A4A;
    --muted:      #5C7068;
    --divider:    rgba(24, 51, 47, 0.1);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Shared ── */
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  p {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--green-mid); color: #fff; }

  .btn-primary-light {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-primary-light:hover { background: var(--limestone); }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .page-hero {
    background: var(--limestone);
    padding: 80px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .page-subhead {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--green-mid);
    opacity: 0.85;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ── Programs ── */
  .section-programs {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    padding: 80px 0 100px;
  }

  .program-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .program-row:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .program-row--featured {
    background: #fff;
    margin: 0 -2.5rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .program-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }

  .program-num {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .program-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .program-tagline {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--silver);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .program-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .meta-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .meta-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--silver);
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  /* ── Program includes ── */
  .program-includes {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .includes-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .include-item {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--body-color);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .include-item::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .include-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .section-cta {
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .cta-inner { max-width: 600px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .program-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .program-left {
      position: static;
    }

    .program-row--featured {
      margin: 0 -1.5rem;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .section-programs { padding: 60px 0; }
    .container { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>